media: ipu6: IPU4P: make the Surface Pro 7 IR camera stream

The IR ov7251 is on CSI-2 port 1, one lane. It delivered no frames until all
three of these were in place; they were not tested separately here:
- PHY building block 8, as reported by JValdivia23 and loafecho
- the shifted data timing of port 2 on port 1 as well, per loafecho
- a 100 us CPU latency limit while the ISYS is powered, per loafecho

Reports: https://github.com/linux-surface/linux-surface/discussions/1353

--- a/drivers/media/pci/intel/ipu6/ipu4p-isys-csi-phy.c
